#: deathforth/blurb/screply.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/screply.df"
msgid "thankuverymuch"
msgstr "땡큐베리머치"

#: deathforth/blurb/screply.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/screply.df"
msgid "heymanthataintcool"
msgstr "헤이맨그건좀아니지"

#: deathforth/blurb/screply.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/screply.df"
msgid "uh huh huh"
msgstr "어 허 허"

#: deathforth/blurb/screply.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/screply.df"
msgid "HO! HO! HO!"
msgstr "호! 호! 호!"

#: deathforth/blurb/screply.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/screply.df"
msgid "THAT SOUNDS LIKE A SAD CHRISTMAS TO MEEEEEE..."
msgstr "그거 슬픈 크리스마스처럼 들리는구나아아아..."

#: deathforth/blurb/screply.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/screply.df"
msgid "HO, HO, HO!"
msgstr "호, 호, 호!"

#: deathforth/blurb/screply.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/screply.df"
msgid "HO HO HO"
msgstr "호 호 호"

#: deathforth/blurb/screply.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/screply.df"
msgid "YEAH! YEAH!"
msgstr "예! 예!"

#: deathforth/blurb/screply.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/screply.df"
msgid "YOU NEED TO TRAIN AND BULK UP!"
msgstr "넌 훈련해서 벌크업해야 해!"

#: deathforth/blurb/screply.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/screply.df"
msgid "BUILD MASS! BUILD BULK!"
msgstr "근육을 키워! 덩치를 키워!"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "the importance of washing your hands"
msgstr "손 씻기의 중요성"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "the importance of boiling water"
msgstr "물 끓이기의 중요성"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "how to properly lift furniture"
msgstr "가구를 제대로 드는 법"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "the best ways to open canned food"
msgstr "통조림을 따는 최고의 방법"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "why you shouldn't trust strangers"
msgstr "낯선 사람을 믿으면 안 되는 이유"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "shot placement to conserve ammo"
msgstr "탄약을 아끼는 조준 위치"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "the importance of sterile medical supplies"
msgstr "의료품 소독의 중요성"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid " talks about "
msgstr "의 수다 주제: "

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "We need to inventory all of our supplies!"
msgstr "우리 물자 재고를 전부 정리해야 해!"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "WE GOT NO TIME FOR THAT TYPE OF BORING STUFF!"
msgstr "그런 지루한 걸 할 시간 없어!"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Sure, maybe when we get some extra time, "
msgstr "그래, 나중에 시간 좀 나면 하자, "

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid ""
"If you tie a string around your finger real tight your finger will turn "
"purple!"
msgstr "손가락에 끈을 꽉 묶으면 손가락이 보라색이 돼!"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Why would I need to know that, "
msgstr "그걸 내가 왜 알아야 하는데, "

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "WHO CARES?"
msgstr "누가 신경 써?"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Good to know, thanks!"
msgstr "알아 두면 좋겠네, 고마워!"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Next time we stop I should show you how to make snare traps."
msgstr "다음에 쉴 때 올가미 덫 만드는 법 보여 줄게."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Maybe next time I should show you how to shut your trap!"
msgstr "다음엔 내가 네 입 다무는 법을 보여 줘야겠다!"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Sounds good to me, "
msgstr "좋은 생각이야, "

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Can any human truly be too swole?"
msgstr "인간이 근육이 너무 많을 수가 있을까?"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "What are you even talking about?"
msgstr "너 대체 무슨 소리 하는 거야?"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "TOO SWOLE TO CONTROLL, BABY. WOO!"
msgstr "근육이 감당 안 돼, 베이비. 우!"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid ""
"If we could get solar panels and a couple batteries, it could come in handy."
msgstr "태양광 패널이랑 배터리 몇 개만 구하면 쓸모가 있을 텐데."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Awesome idea, "
msgstr "좋은 생각이야, "

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "I could hook up my video game console to it!"
msgstr "거기에 내 게임기를 연결할 수 있겠다!"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid ""
"Let's keep our eyes out then. I can see something like that being useful."
msgstr "그럼 잘 찾아보자. 그런 거 있으면 쓸모 있겠어."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:115
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Make sure to keep both hands on the wheel when driving! "
msgstr "운전할 땐 두 손을 꼭 핸들에 올려! "

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Shut it, "
msgstr "닥쳐, "

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "How else am I going to shoot zombies at the same time?"
msgstr "그럼 좀비는 어떻게 동시에 쏘라고?"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:123
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Fine, whatever!"
msgstr "알았어, 맘대로 해!"

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:129
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "We can make it as long as we keep our supplies and morale up."
msgstr "물자랑 사기만 잘 유지하면 우린 해낼 수 있어."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:130
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Don't always have to get every recruit, unless we have lots of food."
msgstr "식량이 넉넉하지 않으면 동료를 다 받아들일 필요는 없어."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:131
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Sometimes it seems worth it to run past a horde instead of fighting."
msgstr "가끔은 무리랑 싸우기보다 그냥 지나쳐 달리는 게 나아."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:132
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "The zombies have an awful lot of trouble with closed doors."
msgstr "좀비들은 닫힌 문을 엄청 힘들어해."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:133
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Really need to be careful with our supply of gas..."
msgstr "기름은 진짜 아껴 써야 해..."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:135
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Try to conserve your ammo, attack only when you have to."
msgstr "탄약을 아껴. 꼭 필요할 때만 공격해."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Shot placement is crucial for making our ammo last."
msgstr "탄약을 오래 쓰려면 조준이 생명이야."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "We should try to find efficient cars to conserve our gas."
msgstr "기름을 아끼려면 연비 좋은 차를 찾아야 해."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Throwing furniture at zombies seems pretty effective."
msgstr "좀비한테 가구를 던지는 게 꽤 효과적인 것 같아."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:140
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "We should bring as little attention to ourselves as possible."
msgstr "최대한 눈에 띄지 않게 다니자."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:141
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "This canned food is a lot better when you're able to heat it up."
msgstr "통조림은 데워 먹으면 훨씬 맛있어."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "It is important to keep set rations to conserve our supplies."
msgstr "물자를 아끼려면 배급량을 정해 두는 게 중요해."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:143
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Things are going good now, but we got to be prepared for anything."
msgstr "지금은 잘 풀리고 있지만, 무슨 일이든 대비해야 해."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:144
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Being prepared is one of the most important parts of survival."
msgstr "대비야말로 생존의 가장 중요한 부분 중 하나야."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Keep your eyes open for anything suspicious."
msgstr "수상한 게 없는지 잘 살펴."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:146
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Zombies are not our only problems out here."
msgstr "여기서 문제는 좀비만이 아니야."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid ""
"We need to be wary of random people, who knows what they are capable of."
msgstr "아무나 경계해야 해. 무슨 짓을 할지 모르니까."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:148
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "We need to watch out for possible bandit ambushes."
msgstr "약탈자 매복을 조심해야 해."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:149
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "It wouldn't be a bad idea to try to hunt for food when possible."
msgstr "가능하면 사냥으로 식량을 구하는 것도 나쁘지 않아."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:150
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "Conserve your water, we don't want to waste any."
msgstr "물은 아껴. 한 방울도 낭비하면 안 돼."

#: deathforth/blurb/sharp.df:151
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sharp.df"
msgid "You can slow zombies down by dropping furniture in front of them."
msgstr "좀비 앞에 가구를 떨어뜨리면 속도를 늦출 수 있어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "BAYY-OH-NETTIIII!"
msgstr "베이이-요-네타아아!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "No such thing as driving too fast!~"
msgstr "과속 같은 건 없어!~"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "There were these vampires, once..."
msgstr "예전에 뱀파이어들이 있었는데..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "Nobody keeps up with me!~"
msgstr "아무도 날 못 따라와!~"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "PARRY THRUST SMASH BANG BANG BANG BANG!"
msgstr "패리 찌르기 스매시 빵 빵 빵 빵!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "One time, my gun heels when off while sleeping."
msgstr "한번은 자다가 총 달린 하이힐이 발사됐어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "I tied these heels on...my foot is one big blister."
msgstr "하이힐을 묶어 신었더니... 발이 온통 물집이야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "Curiously - I've never held an actual musket or bayonet."
msgstr "신기하게도 진짜 머스킷이나 총검은 한 번도 들어 본 적 없어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "Zombies! Why did it have to be zombies?!"
msgstr "좀비! 왜 하필 좀비야?!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "Look at what those zombies have done to my outfit. So impatient..."
msgstr "좀비들이 내 옷을 이렇게 만들어 놨어. 성질도 급하지..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "You know what I need? Some heels without guns."
msgstr "나한테 필요한 게 뭔지 알아? 총 안 달린 하이힐."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "You know, I try to avoid doing this in my Sunday best."
msgstr "있잖아, 이건 제일 좋은 옷 입고는 안 하려고 하거든."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "Women of our caliber don't need invitations, darling."
msgstr "우리 같은 급의 여자는 초대장이 필요 없어, 자기."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "One day, a kid offered to skip with me. Last time I EVER do that."
msgstr "한번은 꼬마가 같이 줄넘기하자고 했어. 그게 마지막이었지."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "Whaaaaaat, you didn't like my choir performance?"
msgstr "뭐어어어, 내 합창 공연이 별로였어?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "IT'S MY SYMPHONY OF DESTRUCTION!"
msgstr "이건 나의 파괴의 교향곡이다!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "Try 4 wheels for size!~"
msgstr "바퀴 4개짜리 맛 좀 봐라!~"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "Do I smell like gunpowder to you yet?"
msgstr "나한테 아직 화약 냄새 나?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "It's the witching hour~"
msgstr "마녀의 시간이야~"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "BAY-AHHH-NETTII!!!"
msgstr "베이-아아-네티이!!!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/bayonetta.df"
msgid "BAYYYYYOOOOONETTTTIIIIIII!"
msgstr "베이이이이요오오오네에에에타아아아!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "Remind me, which one of us controls time, again?"
msgstr "다시 말해 봐, 우리 중에 시간을 다스리는 게 누구라고?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "TEMPUS...nah, just kidding."
msgstr "템푸스... 아냐, 농담이야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "My father was a digital clock. And before that, a grandfather clock."
msgstr "우리 아버지는 디지털시계였어. 그 전엔 괘종시계였고."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "I take a lot of offense to TICK TOCK actually."
msgstr "사실 '째깍째깍'이라는 말은 꽤 기분 나빠."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "You're really WINDING ME UP, haha...HAHAHAHAHA"
msgstr "너 진짜 날 태엽 감듯 약 올리네, 하하...하하하하하"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "DING DONG. Who does the bell toll for? YOU."
msgstr "딩동. 저 종은 누구를 위해 울리지? 너."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "ASK NOT FOR WHOM THE BELL TOLLS..."
msgstr "누구를 위하여 종이 울리는지 묻지 마라..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "FOR WHOM...DOES THAT BELL NOW TOLL?"
msgstr "누구를 위하여... 이제 저 종이 울리는가?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "DON'T SAY ZA WARUDO. I'M WATCHING YOU! DON'T DO IT!"
msgstr "'자 와루도' 하지 마. 지켜보고 있다! 하지 마!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "WHO IS THIS 'JO-JO'?"
msgstr "그 '죠죠'라는 놈은 누구지?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "I HAVE A WHOLE HOST OF ESOTERIC HEROES TO FIGHT STILL!"
msgstr "아직 싸워야 할 마이너한 영웅들이 잔뜩 있다!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "The crown marks the king."
msgstr "왕관이 왕을 말해 준다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "Oh, I just can't wait to be king."
msgstr "아, 빨리 왕이 되고 싶어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "i've a bone to pick with caesium-133."
msgstr "세슘-133이랑은 따질 게 좀 있어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "AND WHEN I'M KING OF CANADA, TIME WILL STOP FOREVER!"
msgstr "그리고 내가 캐나다의 왕이 되면, 시간은 영원히 멈출 것이다!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "Einstein's problem was that he wasn't born as a deity."
msgstr "아인슈타인의 문제는 신으로 태어나지 않았다는 거지."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "I trust this will all make sense in the course of...nevermind."
msgstr "이 모든 게 시간이 지나면... 아니, 됐다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "Oh? A race against the CLOCK? YEAH. HAHA. VERY FUNNY."
msgstr "오? 시간과의 경주라고? 그래. 하하. 아주 재밌네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "Wonder if anybody would notice if I timestopped to pick my nose..."
msgstr "시간 멈추고 코 파도 아무도 모르겠지..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "It's a good thing I don't have a neck. My crown would crush it."
msgstr "목이 없는 게 다행이야. 있었으면 왕관이 짓눌렀을 거야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/clockking.df"
msgid "IF I COULD TURRRRNNNNN BACK TIMEEEEEEE..."
msgstr "시간을 되돌릴 수만 있다며어어언..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid ""
"STEPPPPPP RIGHT UP or don't, I don't care. It's not like its a big deal..."
msgstr "자아아아, 어서 오세요. 아니면 말고, 상관없어. 별일도 아니고..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "A CRACK OF THE WHIP SHALL MAKE THE BANDIT QUIT!"
msgstr "채찍 한 방이면 약탈자도 물러나리라!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "These RAPSCALLIONS do not know DISCIPLINE as I do."
msgstr "이 악당들은 나만큼 규율을 모르는군."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "Don't worry, I know I'm better than you."
msgstr "걱정 마, 내가 너보다 나은 건 나도 알아."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "BY JOVE I need the loo."
msgstr "맙소사, 화장실 가고 싶군."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "AND THE CONFECTIONARY STAND shall be open in approximately NEVER."
msgstr "그리고 매점은 대략... 영원히 안 엽니다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "I'm so tired of performing all the time."
msgstr "매일 공연하는 거 너무 지쳤어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "'The show must go on'...to heck with the damn show."
msgstr "'쇼는 계속되어야 한다'... 빌어먹을 쇼 따위 집어치워."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "Blast, Spidey's spoiled the seat again."
msgstr "제길, 스파이디가 또 좌석을 망쳐 놨군."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "The world seems so bent on pulling itself apart."
msgstr "세상이 스스로를 찢어발기려고 안달이 난 것 같아."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "AND FOR MY NEXT TRICK...HANDLESS DRIVING"
msgstr "다음 묘기는... 손 놓고 운전하기"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "AND FOR OUR FIRST ACT...BREAKING THE SPEED LIMIT"
msgstr "첫 번째 공연은... 속도위반"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "PLEASE WELCOME TO THE STAGE...CRIPPLING SADNESS!"
msgstr "무대 위로 모십니다... 극심한 우울!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "At least the audiences are larger. A bit more dead than usual though."
msgstr "그래도 관객은 늘었어. 평소보다 좀 많이 죽어 있긴 하지만."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid ""
"Spidey's got a good taste for zombie. Which is great, since he won't eat me."
msgstr "스파이디는 좀비를 좋아해. 덕분에 날 안 잡아먹으니 다행이지."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "Wonder if I can whip zombies from the car..."
msgstr "차에서 좀비한테 채찍질할 수 있을까..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "The plight of our audience is ours."
msgstr "관객의 고난이 곧 우리의 고난이다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "A smidge of makeup might help. Also: showering."
msgstr "화장을 좀 하면 나을지도. 그리고 샤워도."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "Rather makes me miss my dress collection."
msgstr "내 드레스 컬렉션이 그리워지는군."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid "Cigarette? Just kidding, smoking is BANNED in my circus."
msgstr "담배? 농담이야. 내 서커스에선 흡연 금지야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/condor.df"
msgid ""
"I feel so tired...like I could sleep a million years, and still not be "
"rested."
msgstr "너무 피곤해... 백만 년을 자도 피로가 안 풀릴 것 같아."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "The only person I need is me."
msgstr "내게 필요한 건 나 하나뿐이야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "As they say, finders keepers!"
msgstr "줍는 사람이 임자라잖아!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "If you turn into a zombie, I'm outta here."
msgstr "너 좀비 되면 난 튄다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "I should've done this all on my own."
msgstr "처음부터 혼자 할 걸 그랬어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "One time, I stole this nerd's lunch money!"
msgstr "한번은 어떤 찐따 점심값을 뺏은 적 있어!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Don't worry, I can keep allll your supplies safe."
msgstr "걱정 마, 너희 물자는 내가 저어언부 안전하게 보관해 줄게."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Imagine if bandits jumped us right now? What would you do?"
msgstr "지금 약탈자가 덮치면 어쩔래? 뭐 할 건데?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "I ate your leftovers, by the way."
msgstr "그나저나 네가 남긴 거 내가 먹었어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Once, I found a wallet and didn't turn it in..."
msgstr "한번은 지갑을 주웠는데 안 돌려줬지..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Aaaaand there goes another zombie!"
msgstr "그리고 좀비 하나 또 간다아아!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Here's a very simple rule: I'm always better than you!"
msgstr "아주 간단한 규칙: 난 언제나 너보다 낫다!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Dinks here. Dinks there. Life's relentless."
msgstr "여기도 나쁜 놈, 저기도 나쁜 놈. 인생 참 가혹해."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "I'll always be here for you...maybe."
msgstr "난 언제나 네 곁에 있을게... 아마도."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "All I'm saying is, the bandits have the right idea."
msgstr "그러니까 내 말은, 약탈자들 생각이 맞다는 거야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Ever kicked an inflatable puppy before?"
msgstr "바람 넣은 강아지 인형 차 본 적 있어?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Threatening people can be really effective, actually."
msgstr "사실 사람 협박하는 거 꽤 효과적이야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "I took the last loo roll. Sorry."
msgstr "마지막 휴지 내가 썼어. 미안."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "My car...I mean uhm, our car, is great."
msgstr "내 차... 아니 음, 우리 차 좋네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "I wanna raise a zombie army and take over Canada!"
msgstr "좀비 군단을 키워서 캐나다를 정복하고 싶어!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Survival of the fittest...in OBAMA'S AMERICA."
msgstr "적자생존... 오바마의 미국에서."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "What were you saying? I wasn't listening."
msgstr "뭐라고 했어? 안 듣고 있었는데."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "I'm not a bad person. A bad person would've left by now."
msgstr "난 나쁜 사람 아니야. 나쁜 사람이었으면 벌써 떠났지."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Just wait until I reveal the 6th layer of my disguise!"
msgstr "내 변장의 6번째 층을 공개할 때까지 기다려!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Thinking about it, the USA kinda sucks."
msgstr "생각해 보면 미국 좀 별로야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "YEAH! THANKS OBAMA."
msgstr "그래! 고맙다 오바마."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "I think the zombies improved things somewhat."
msgstr "좀비 덕분에 좀 나아진 것도 있는 것 같아."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "No more traffic, no more train delays!"
msgstr "교통 체증도 없고, 열차 지연도 없고!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "With or without the zombies?"
msgstr "좀비가 있는 거야, 없는 거야?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:87
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Where I'm from, I'm known for landing a plane all by myself."
msgstr "우리 동네에선 혼자 비행기 착륙시킨 걸로 유명했어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "WOW! You must be some kind of...SPACE DINGUS!"
msgstr "우와! 너 무슨... 우주 바보라도 되는 거야?!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Can you tell the truth, just one time?"
msgstr "한 번이라도 진실을 말해 줄 수 없어?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Hey. Hey. Guess. Guess what? Guess what?"
msgstr "야. 야. 맞혀 봐. 맞혀 봐. 뭔지 알아?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "What, "
msgstr "뭐, "

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "? JUST SPIT IT OUT ALREADY!"
msgstr "? 빨리 말해!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:112
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Did you say something?"
msgstr "뭐라고 했어?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:122
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "If I was president, these zombies would've never happened."
msgstr "내가 대통령이었으면 이 좀비 사태는 절대 안 일어났어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "HECK YEAH! DOWN WITH THE ZOMBIES!"
msgstr "그렇지! 좀비 타도!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:131
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "AND WHAT ABOUT YOUR TAX POLICY, NERD?"
msgstr "그럼 네 세금 정책은 뭔데, 찐따야?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df:134
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/disloyal.df"
msgid "Perhaps you're right, "
msgstr "네 말이 맞을지도, "

