msgid "save   us"
msgstr "살 려 줘"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "THIS ONE TIME, ME AND THIS TONER PRINTER REALLY HIT IT OFF."
msgstr "한번은 나랑 토너 프린터가 아주 죽이 잘 맞았지."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "BEST THING ABOUT ROBOTICS...FREE SURGERY."
msgstr "로봇 공학의 최고 장점... 공짜 수술."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "BABY I'M LIKE A DOLL, TAKE ME APART AND BEAT ME WITH A BAT"
msgstr "베이비 난 인형 같아, 날 분해해서 배트로 두들겨 줘"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "NOW, WHERE DID I LEAVE MY HEAD?-"
msgstr "자, 내 머리를 어디 뒀더라?-"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "THE GAS PORT KEEPS EYEING ME UP."
msgstr "주유구가 자꾸 날 훑어봐."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "BIGGER IS ALWAYS BETTER. I AM OF COURSE TALKING ABOUT MAULS"
msgstr "클수록 좋지. 물론 대형 망치 얘기야"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid ""
"LET ME HOLD ALL THE GAS CANS. I PROMISE I WILL KEEP THEM AT THEIR CURRENT "
"VOLUME"
msgstr "기름통은 전부 내가 들게. 지금 양 그대로 유지할게, 약속해"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "I AM WANTED BY THE POLICE FOR 42 COUNTS OF WANTON DESTRUCTION"
msgstr "난 무분별한 파괴 42건으로 경찰에 수배 중이야"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid ""
"FUN FACT - NOTHING MATTERS OR IS REAL. THE COLD WET GROUND AWAITS US. FUN!"
msgstr "재밌는 사실 - 아무것도 중요하지 않고 진짜도 아니야. 차갑고 축축한 땅이 우릴 기다리지. 재밌다!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "THEY CALL ME THE GAS GUZZLER, BECAUSE I'M REALLY INTO WOMEN."
msgstr "사람들은 날 기름 먹는 하마라고 불러. 여자를 엄청 밝히거든."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "BEEP BOOP IS SORT OF A REALLY MEAN THING TO SAY"
msgstr "'삐 뽀'는 꽤 심한 말이야"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "LIFE...HOORAY!"
msgstr "인생... 만세!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "I DID NOT CARE FOR THE TERMINATOR."
msgstr "터미네이터는 별로였어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "PLEASE POINT OUT ANY CYANIDE PILLS. THANK YOU IN ADVANCE"
msgstr "청산가리 알약이 보이면 알려 줘. 미리 고마워"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "YOUR CALL IS REALLY IMPORTANT TO US. PLEASE HOLD."
msgstr "고객님의 전화는 저희에게 정말 중요합니다. 잠시만 기다려 주십시오."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "FOR MAUL ENQUIRIES, PRESS 1. FOR SPLITTING YOUR SKULL, PRESS 2."
msgstr "대형 망치 문의는 1번. 두개골 쪼개기는 2번을 눌러 주십시오."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "DID YOU SEE THAT SPEED CAMERA? SHE IS A LOOKER."
msgstr "저 과속 카메라 봤어? 완전 미인이야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "HA-HA. THE PASSAGE OF TIME IS RELENTLESS AND UNFORGIVING. HA-HA."
msgstr "하-하. 시간의 흐름은 가혹하고 무자비하다. 하-하."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "GASSSS IN MA BELLYYYYYY. THERE'S GAS IN MA BELLYYYYYYY."
msgstr "배 속에 기르으으음. 내 배 속에 기름이 있어어어어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "MAMA SAID IM A REAL COWBOY. SHE WAS WRONG. I AM NEITHER COW OR BOY"
msgstr "엄마가 나보고 진짜 카우보이래. 틀렸어. 난 소도 아니고 보이도 아니야"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/ember.df"
msgid "I'M A REAL SMASH HIT. SO MUCH SO I EVEN MADE MY FATHER CRY"
msgstr "난 진짜 대박 히트작이야. 아빠까지 울렸다니까"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "I should've just leapt all the way to Canada!"
msgstr "그냥 캐나다까지 점프해서 갈 걸 그랬어!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "Can I do the gears?"
msgstr "기어 내가 바꿔도 돼?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "Got any protein? My knees are killing me."
msgstr "단백질 있어? 무릎이 죽겠어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "Sometimes I pose for posters, as a treat."
msgstr "가끔 포스터 모델도 해. 나한테 주는 선물로."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "AND IF WE EVER NEED AN ANCHOR - I'VE GOT YOU COVERED!"
msgstr "그리고 닻이 필요하면 - 나만 믿어!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "Guess I'm the captain of this car..."
msgstr "아무래도 이 차의 선장은 나인 것 같네..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "Beans help me leap. Don't ask why."
msgstr "콩을 먹으면 점프를 잘해. 이유는 묻지 마."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "Can I interest you in a half-ton anchor? No? Okay."
msgstr "반 톤짜리 닻에 관심 있어? 없어? 알았어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "Got any frozen ham?"
msgstr "냉동 햄 있어?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "If I wasn't lugging around this anchor I'd be an olympian."
msgstr "이 닻만 안 끌고 다녔으면 올림픽 선수가 됐을 거야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "I'VE FOUGHT EVERYTHING, FROM SEA SERPENTS TO YOUR DAD."
msgstr "난 바다뱀부터 너희 아빠까지 안 싸워 본 게 없다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "IS IT A BIRD? IS IT A PLANE? NO, IT'S ME!"
msgstr "새냐? 비행기냐? 아니, 나다!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "If I just keep leaping over zombies..."
msgstr "계속 좀비를 뛰어넘다 보면..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "When I learn to hold the car AND leap, the apocalypse will be over."
msgstr "차를 든 채로 점프하는 법을 익히면 종말도 끝날 거야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "I also make a mean quiche."
msgstr "키슈도 끝내주게 만들어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "Ever been in a tsunami? No? Okay."
msgstr "쓰나미 겪어 본 적 있어? 없어? 알았어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "There's nothing like crushing a zombie into fine pulp."
msgstr "좀비를 곤죽으로 짓이기는 것만 한 게 없지."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "At least with my anchor, nobody can steal our car anymore."
msgstr "그래도 내 닻이 있으니 아무도 우리 차를 못 훔쳐 가."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "Make sure to flip off the zombies as you go by!"
msgstr "지나가면서 좀비들한테 손가락 욕 날려 주는 거 잊지 마!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "I TURN ZOMBIES INTO MERINGUE!"
msgstr "좀비를 머랭으로 만들어 주마!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/gladiator.df"
msgid "OH, TO LEAVE THE BOUNDS OF EARTH...AND PUNCH THE FACE OF ZOMBS!"
msgstr "오, 대지의 속박을 벗어나... 좀비 얼굴에 주먹을!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "We'll get there. For sure!"
msgstr "우린 도착할 거야. 틀림없이!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "Call me 'sunflower', the way my armor's so yellow."
msgstr "갑옷이 노래서 날 '해바라기'라고 불러 줘."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "I wonder how things are up north?"
msgstr "북쪽은 사정이 어떨까?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "SYCAMORE...HEED MY CALL!"
msgstr "시카모어여... 나의 부름에 응하라!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "MY OATH COMPELS ME...to drive for a bit."
msgstr "나의 맹세가 명하노니... 잠깐 운전 좀 할게."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "SUNDER THE HERETICAL!"
msgstr "이단자를 베어라!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "I'm not giving up. Not now. Not yet."
msgstr "포기 안 해. 지금은. 아직은."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "^W^"
msgstr "^W^"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "'The dawn shall be radiant!'...so sayeth the wise sun."
msgstr "'새벽은 찬란하리라!'... 지혜로운 태양이 그리 말씀하셨지."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "Hungry work, lugging this armor about."
msgstr "이 갑옷 끌고 다니려니 배고프네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "MY OATH COMPELS ME...to stop the car for a loo break."
msgstr "나의 맹세가 명하노니... 화장실 가게 차 좀 세워 줘."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "SMITE THE FIENDS! SLAY THE FIENDS! FOR SUNLIGHT!"
msgstr "악마를 쳐라! 악마를 베어라! 햇빛을 위하여!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "I once had a puppy. I hope she survived..."
msgstr "강아지를 키웠었는데. 살아 있으면 좋겠다..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "I'd sooner die than let the zombies win."
msgstr "좀비가 이기게 두느니 차라리 죽겠어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "Sorry about all the blinding lights. It kinda just happens."
msgstr "눈부신 빛은 미안. 그냥 저절로 나와."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "THIS CAR NEEDS MORE LIGHTS!"
msgstr "이 차엔 빛이 더 필요해!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid ""
"Okay. I'll tell you what. You carry a sword around for 20 years and we'll "
"compare notes."
msgstr "그래, 이렇게 하자. 너도 검을 20년 들고 다녀 봐, 그다음에 얘기하자."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "For sure!"
msgstr "틀림없이!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid ""
"If you see any dresses, they're mine. What, a paladin gal can't dress nice, "
"too?"
msgstr "드레스가 보이면 내 거야. 뭐, 성기사 아가씨는 옷 좀 잘 입으면 안 돼?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid ""
"NO FIEND TOO BIG, NO MONSTER TOO BIG, unless it's about 8 foot tall or so."
msgstr "너무 큰 악마도, 너무 큰 괴물도 없다. 키가 2.5미터쯤 넘지만 않으면."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/izzydialogue.df"
msgid "I love sunflowers. They're so adorable."
msgstr "해바라기 좋아. 너무 귀여워."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Well, I'm not going anywhere fast."
msgstr "뭐, 난 어디 안 가."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "We should help whoever we can. You never know who'll need it!"
msgstr "도울 수 있는 사람은 도와야 해. 누가 도움이 필요할지 모르잖아!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Everybody's just trying to survive. Why should we make it worse?"
msgstr "다들 그냥 살아남으려는 것뿐이야. 우리가 왜 더 나쁘게 만들어?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Apocalypse aside, the USA is still our country!"
msgstr "종말이든 뭐든, 미국은 여전히 우리나라야!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "U-S-A!"
msgstr "유-에스-에이!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "I wonder how my hometown is doing?"
msgstr "우리 고향은 어떻게 됐을까?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "For sure, buddy!"
msgstr "물론이지, 친구!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Be sure to say thank you to the car."
msgstr "차한테 고맙다고 꼭 말해 줘."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Want a snack bar?"
msgstr "에너지바 먹을래?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "If we could just help the zombies..."
msgstr "좀비들을 도와줄 수만 있다면..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Do you think there'll ever be a cure?"
msgstr "언젠가 치료제가 나올까?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "We should get a bigger car so we can save more people."
msgstr "사람들을 더 구할 수 있게 더 큰 차를 구하자."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "I'll always be here for you! Probably."
msgstr "난 언제나 네 곁에 있을게! 아마도."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "You can talk to me, you know."
msgstr "나한테 털어놔도 돼, 알지?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Just say if you need something, OK?"
msgstr "필요한 거 있으면 말만 해, 알았지?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "I'll make it to Canada...for you."
msgstr "캐나다까지 갈 거야... 너를 위해서."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Someday, when this is over, want to watch a bad movie together?"
msgstr "언젠가 이게 다 끝나면, 같이 구린 영화 볼래?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Maybe we could drive AROUND the zombies?"
msgstr "좀비를 돌아서 가면 안 될까?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Just gotta hold on a little longer."
msgstr "조금만 더 버티면 돼."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "I'd open a big sanctuary for all these strays if I could."
msgstr "할 수만 있다면 떠돌이 동물들을 위한 큰 보호소를 열고 싶어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "And if anybody's hurt, I can try to help."
msgstr "그리고 누가 다치면 내가 도와볼게."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Do you think zombies feel pain?"
msgstr "좀비도 아픔을 느낄까?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "One time I got to pet a brown bear. Then I got mauled..."
msgstr "한번은 불곰을 쓰다듬어 본 적 있어. 그러고 나서 물어뜯겼지..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Are you alright?"
msgstr "괜찮아?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "No, I'm all left."
msgstr "아니, 안 괜찮아. 괜찮은 척하는 거야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "WE'RE IN THE MIDDLE OF THE APOCALYPSE."
msgstr "지금 종말 한복판이잖아."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "WHAT DO YOU THINK?"
msgstr "어떨 것 같아?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Keeping it together, I guess."
msgstr "그럭저럭 버티는 중이야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:87
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "I won't leave you, even if you turn zombie."
msgstr "네가 좀비가 되더라도 난 널 안 떠날 거야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Yay! We can be zombies together!"
msgstr "야호! 같이 좀비 되면 되겠다!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Oh. Thanks, that's nice."
msgstr "아. 고마워, 다정하네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "We should raise an army to get to Canada!"
msgstr "캐나다에 가려면 군대를 모아야 해!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Yeah, "
msgstr "그래, "

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "! More people to rob!"
msgstr "! 털어먹을 사람이 늘겠네!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Heck yeah! Who's gonna stop us?"
msgstr "당연하지! 누가 우릴 막겠어?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "If we have spare supplies, we should help others out."
msgstr "물자가 남으면 다른 사람들을 도와야 해."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "FRIENDSHIP POWER!"
msgstr "우정 파워!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:129
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "It's every man for himself out here!"
msgstr "여기선 각자도생이야!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "Bit of a departure from my original commission, I admit."
msgstr "원래 의뢰랑은 좀 거리가 멀어졌네, 인정해."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "If you kick me out of my own car, I'm gonna be pissed."
msgstr "내 차에서 날 쫓아내면 진짜 화낼 거야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "We need a better car with even more armor and guns."
msgstr "장갑이랑 총이 더 달린 더 좋은 차가 필요해."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "And then came my ship, charging in from the fog..."
msgstr "그리고 내 배가 안개를 뚫고 돌진해 왔지..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "I did not care for the Admiral's pie."
msgstr "제독의 파이는 별로였어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "Less ear-shattering booms, a lot more undead."
msgstr "귀청 터지는 폭음은 줄고, 언데드는 훨씬 늘었네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "Want a can of eels?"
msgstr "장어 통조림 먹을래?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "That's ADMIRAL Merenja Raven, to you."
msgstr "나한텐 메렌자 레이븐 '제독님'이라고 불러."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "Here, have this handbook. You can wipe your butt with it."
msgstr "자, 이 안내서 줄게. 밑 닦는 데 써도 돼."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "Need to find myself a chainsaw or two..."
msgstr "전기톱 한두 개는 구해야겠어..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "Haha, you think zombies are bad? Try the open ocean."
msgstr "하하, 좀비가 무섭다고? 망망대해에 가 봐."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "Sure, this is bad, but not as bad as having your hull breached."
msgstr "그래, 이것도 나쁘지만 선체에 구멍 나는 것만큼은 아니야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "It - it doesn't matter how large my vessel was or wasn't!"
msgstr "내, 내 배가 컸는지 작았는지는 중요하지 않아!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "Best thing about the road? Less barnacles."
msgstr "육로의 최고 장점? 따개비가 적다는 거."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "Hang on, I didn't realise we had heated seats!"
msgstr "잠깐, 열선 시트가 있는 줄 몰랐네!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "My old vessel even had sonar. They really thought of everything."
msgstr "내 옛날 배엔 소나도 있었어. 진짜 별걸 다 생각했다니까."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "What do you mean all your rivers have bridges across them?"
msgstr "강마다 다리가 놓여 있다니 그게 무슨 소리야?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "Wanderers are as wanderers be..."
msgstr "방랑자는 방랑자일 뿐..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "Shall I open a beer bottle?"
msgstr "맥주병 하나 딸까?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid ""
"A good captain goes down with her ship. A better captain sinks the other "
"ship first."
msgstr "훌륭한 선장은 배와 함께 가라앉지. 더 훌륭한 선장은 상대 배를 먼저 가라앉히고."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/merenja.df"
msgid "Need to attach some harpoons to this thing..."
msgstr "이거에 작살 몇 개 달아야겠어..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "It was me and the death roaders...in the summer of 2016."
msgstr "나랑 데스 로더들이었지... 2016년 여름에."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "Leave the gun. Take the strawberry flavour yoghurt."
msgstr "총은 두고, 딸기 요거트는 챙겨."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "Forget zombies. What about the IRS?"
msgstr "좀비는 잊어. 국세청은 어쩔 건데?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "I've got lots of cars! Mainly in red. All in red, actually..."
msgstr "차 많아! 주로 빨간색. 사실 전부 빨간색이야..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "This better not take long."
msgstr "오래 걸리면 곤란해."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "This was my territory. Well, not really, but it is now."
msgstr "여긴 내 구역이었어. 뭐, 사실 아니었지만 이젠 그래."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "Capiche? Capiche."
msgstr "알아들어? 알아들었지."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "Now I'm here, you don't gotta worry 'bout nothin'."
msgstr "내가 왔으니 이제 아무 걱정 안 해도 돼."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "Do you smell bacon?"
msgstr "베이컨 냄새 안 나?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "Al Zombo needs clipping. Y'know what I mean?"
msgstr "알 좀보를 손봐야겠어. 무슨 말인지 알지?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "All these zombies, makin' me look like a fool."
msgstr "이 좀비들이 날 바보로 만들고 있어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "'Mobster' is such a loaded word."
msgstr "'마피아'라는 말은 너무 어감이 세."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "Don Car looks worse everyday. They made him a captain."
msgstr "돈 카는 날이 갈수록 꼴이 말이 아니야. 그래서 간부로 앉혔지."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "Ayyyyyy. Ayyy!"
msgstr "에에에에에이. 에에에이!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "Ayyyyyy! Watchin' the road 'ere!"
msgstr "에에에에에이! 여기 운전 중이잖아!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "These zombies put a hit on me! On ME! The don!"
msgstr "이 좀비들이 내 목에 현상금을 걸었어! 나한테! 돈한테!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "Listen to me carefully..."
msgstr "내 말 잘 들어..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "We should burn down Canada, take the insurance money."
msgstr "캐나다를 불태우고 보험금을 타자."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "We'll push the Canadians over in no time."
msgstr "캐나다 놈들은 금방 굴복시킬 거야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "Let's make some moonshine."
msgstr "밀주나 좀 만들자."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/mobster.df"
msgid "Hmmm...this could be a great smuggling opportunity."
msgstr "흠... 밀수하기 딱 좋은 기회인데."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "Hehehe...I probably shouldn't have done that."
msgstr "헤헤헤... 아마 그러면 안 됐던 것 같아."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "Hey guys, remember when this wasn't my fault?"
msgstr "얘들아, 이게 내 잘못이 아니었던 때 기억나?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "Ow. Ow. Still ow."
msgstr "아야. 아야. 여전히 아야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "This is worse than that time I fought a chicken."
msgstr "닭이랑 싸웠던 때보다 더 심하네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "Don't worry. I've got a thing. I dunno what it is yet."
msgstr "걱정 마. 나한테 수가 있어. 그게 뭔지는 아직 모르지만."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "I don't wanna alarm anybody, but I'm doing my best."
msgstr "다들 놀라게 하고 싶진 않은데, 나 최선을 다하고 있어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "Alright, nobody freak out. I already did."
msgstr "좋아, 다들 진정해. 난 이미 멘붕 왔어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "I HATE YOU BEES, I HATE YOU BEES, I HATE YOU..."
msgstr "벌들아 싫어, 벌들아 싫어, 싫어..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "I've got a whole CARTON OF CIGARETTES!"
msgstr "나한테 담배 한 보루 통째로 있어!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "WELLLLLLLP 'BOUT TIME FOR ME TO BE HITTIN' THE OLD DUSTY TRAIL..."
msgstr "자아아아아, 이제 슬슬 먼지 날리는 옛길로 떠나 볼 시간이군..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "I can't believe we're goin' to Canada!"
msgstr "우리가 캐나다에 간다니 믿기지 않아!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "My alphabits have a mysterious message. It says ooooooooo."
msgstr "알파벳 시리얼에 수수께끼 메시지가 있어. '오오오오오오오오'래."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "ROADHOUSE."
msgstr "로드하우스."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "When you poop in your dreams... You poop for real."
msgstr "꿈에서 똥 싸면... 현실에서도 싼다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "Yeah I'm a DINGUS. A real DINK. Whaddya mean I can't say that?"
msgstr "그래, 나 바보야. 진짜 멍청이지. 뭐, 그런 말 하면 안 된다고?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "This is worse than that one time I went to Canada."
msgstr "이건 내가 캐나다 갔을 때보다 더 심하네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "I bet...5 dollars that J*e is still in a wheelchair."
msgstr "5달러 건다, J*e는 아직 휠체어 타고 있을걸."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "You know what really grinds my gears?"
msgstr "내 속을 진짜 뒤집는 게 뭔지 알아?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "Do you, or do you not know about the bird?"
msgstr "너 그 새 얘기 알아, 몰라?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "This is like that time I was on daytime TV."
msgstr "내가 낮 방송에 나갔던 때랑 똑같네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/pewter.df"
msgid "Hehehehehehehehe."
msgstr "헤헤헤헤헤헤헤헤."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "No, I don't believe in 'Kepa', shut up."
msgstr "아니, 난 '케파' 안 믿어. 닥쳐."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes I know the goop smells. Okay, well, if you die, I don't want to "
"hear complaining."
msgstr "그래, 그래, 끈적이 냄새나는 거 알아. 좋아, 그럼 죽어도 불평하지 마."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "What a ruin...so much knowledge wasted."
msgstr "폐허가 됐군... 이 많은 지식이 낭비되다니."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "I wander what pa would be up to now..."
msgstr "아빠는 지금쯤 뭐 하고 계실까..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "I keep other things in my satchel too you know. Ever played poker?"
msgstr "가방엔 다른 것도 넣고 다녀, 알잖아. 포커 쳐 봤어?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "You don't want to know how the goop is made. TRUST ME."
msgstr "끈적이를 어떻게 만드는지는 모르는 게 좋아. 날 믿어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "Shall I make us something to eat?"
msgstr "먹을 거 좀 만들어 줄까?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "You've never been hit round the head with a satchel before, have you?"
msgstr "가방으로 머리 맞아 본 적 없지?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid ""
"I almost prefer things this way. There's less screaming, more groaning."
msgstr "차라리 이게 나은 것 같기도 해. 비명은 적고 신음은 많고."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "Wonder if we'll meet any other doctors around here..."
msgstr "이 근처에서 다른 의사를 만날 수 있을까..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "I already can't wait for this catastrophe to be over."
msgstr "벌써부터 이 재앙이 빨리 끝났으면 좋겠어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "We need to stockpile medicine. We never know what's around the corner."
msgstr "약을 비축해 둬야 해. 언제 무슨 일이 생길지 몰라."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "I know I go on, sometimes, but I'm here for you."
msgstr "내가 가끔 말이 많긴 하지만, 난 네 편이야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "Come on. Chin up. We can make it, still."
msgstr "자. 고개 들어. 아직 해낼 수 있어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "Look, look. It's not my fault you stink of purple reeds."
msgstr "이봐, 이봐. 네가 보라색 갈대 냄새 나는 건 내 잘못이 아니야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "Hmm...got a spare flint and steel around?"
msgstr "흠... 부싯돌이랑 부시 남는 거 있어?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "We're gonna make it through this. Come on. We've got this."
msgstr "우린 이겨 낼 거야. 자. 할 수 있어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid ""
"Did you try the medicine drug? Only stupid people try the medicine drug."
msgstr "약 하는 약 해 봤어? 바보들만 약 하는 약을 하지."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "Make sure you're changing your socks often, please."
msgstr "양말 좀 자주 갈아 신어, 제발."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid ""
"This is our burden to bear, because we're the only ones who can carry it."
msgstr "이건 우리가 짊어질 짐이야. 이걸 질 수 있는 건 우리뿐이니까."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rohoa.df"
msgid "In this world the only people we can trust is us."
msgstr "이 세상에서 믿을 건 우리뿐이야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "What wonders shall I see this day?"
msgstr "오늘은 어떤 경이를 보게 될까?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "SOOO...YOU CAN DRIVE THE CAR? WONDERFUL."
msgstr "그러니까아아... 너 차를 운전할 수 있다고? 훌륭해."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "Where shall I go next? Ultimyr University? Canada? Hmm..."
msgstr "다음엔 어디로 갈까? 얼티미르 대학? 캐나다? 흠..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "Oh, if I had father's skill in construction..."
msgstr "아, 아버지만큼 건축 솜씨가 있었다면..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "No, the mask does not come off."
msgstr "아니, 가면은 안 벗겨져."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "Do you mind if I copy the steering wheel?"
msgstr "핸들 좀 복사해도 될까?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "I'm coming, Canadians! Wait for me!"
msgstr "간다, 캐나다 사람들아! 기다려!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "My thirst for knowledge cannot be quenched."
msgstr "지식에 대한 내 갈증은 해소될 수 없다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "No sorcery lies beyond my grasp."
msgstr "내 손이 닿지 않는 마법은 없다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "I am no thief. I merely borrow. The police...disagree."
msgstr "난 도둑이 아니야. 잠깐 빌릴 뿐이지. 경찰은... 생각이 다르지만."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "Hmmm. What a test this shall be..."
msgstr "흠. 이거 제법 시험이 되겠군..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "Mind if I copy your hair? I'm missing some."
msgstr "네 머리카락 좀 복사해도 돼? 나 좀 모자라서."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "No no no, it's not 'counterfeit' money, it's..."
msgstr "아니 아니, 그건 '위조' 지폐가 아니라..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "Excellent idea!"
msgstr "훌륭한 생각이야!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "I could cast a portal, but where's the fun in that?"
msgstr "포탈을 열 수도 있지만, 그럼 재미가 없잖아?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "What is this...'music' that keeps playing?"
msgstr "계속 들리는 이... '음악'은 뭐지?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "WHO is the ulimate magus? That's right. I am."
msgstr "최강의 마법사는 누구? 그래. 나지."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "What's mine is mine and what's yours is also mine."
msgstr "내 건 내 거고 네 것도 내 거야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "I had the strangest dream, that I was standing in a river..."
msgstr "아주 이상한 꿈을 꿨어. 강 한가운데 서 있는 꿈이었지..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "We'd best hope we don't find the anti-magus. He's a real jerk."
msgstr "안티 마법사를 안 만나기를 빌자. 진짜 재수 없는 놈이거든."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/rubick.df"
msgid "Zombies everywhere, Obama, no games...I almost feel bad."
msgstr "사방에 좀비, 오바마, 게임은 없고... 좀 안됐다는 생각까지 드네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "Good thing the halberd fit in the car."
msgstr "미늘창이 차에 들어가서 다행이야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "Guten morgen!"
msgstr "구텐 모르겐!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "Can I interest you in a coocoo clock?"
msgstr "뻐꾸기시계에 관심 있어?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "Interested in buying an old cow bell?"
msgstr "오래된 소 방울 살 생각 있어?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "Of course it's a real job, shut up shut up shut up!"
msgstr "당연히 진짜 직업이지, 닥쳐 닥쳐 닥쳐!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "You've hired the finest pre-modern military in the world."
msgstr "세계 최고의 전근대 군대를 고용하셨습니다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "Our biggest issues - zombies and little red faced men with crossbows."
msgstr "우리의 가장 큰 문제 - 좀비, 그리고 석궁 든 얼굴 빨간 꼬마들."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "I must say, your horse is most unusual."
msgstr "말하는데, 네 말은 참 특이하구나."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "Verdamnt!"
msgstr "페르담트!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "I sleep in the armour too, in case there's a ruffian with a flintlock."
msgstr "수발총 든 불한당이 있을지 몰라서 갑옷 입고 자."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "For der Schweiss!"
msgstr "슈바이츠를 위하여!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "Luckily, I can solve any problems you have that need a 10-foot pole."
msgstr "다행히 3미터짜리 장대가 필요한 문제는 내가 다 해결해 줄 수 있어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "The RCMP are just pretenders. I'm the real deal."
msgstr "기마경찰은 다 가짜야. 진짜는 나라고."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid ""
"I think if every guard was armed with a Toyota, we'd be more effective."
msgstr "경비병마다 도요타로 무장했으면 훨씬 효율적이었을 텐데."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "Don't worry, it's meat slop for dinner tonight."
msgstr "걱정 마, 오늘 저녁은 고기 죽이야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "Other benefits of a halberd - it makes for a crazy kebab skewer."
msgstr "미늘창의 또 다른 장점 - 끝내주는 케밥 꼬치가 돼."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "I don't take responsibility or ownership for Swiss Miss."
msgstr "스위스 미스 코코아는 내 책임도 소유도 아니야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "Never bring a knife to a polearm fight."
msgstr "장창 싸움에 칼 들고 오지 마라."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "Never bring a polearm to a gun fight...okay, maybe sometimes."
msgstr "총싸움에 장창 들고 오지 마라... 뭐, 가끔은 괜찮고."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "Other uses for a halberd - using it like a giant carjack."
msgstr "미늘창의 또 다른 용도 - 거대한 자동차 잭으로 쓰기."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/swiss.df"
msgid "This armour's great for shrapnel. Sucks for zombies."
msgstr "이 갑옷은 파편엔 좋은데. 좀비한텐 꽝이야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "MAN SUPPOSES...ZEUS DISPOSES."
msgstr "계획은 인간이 세우고... 결정은 제우스가 한다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "OF ALL OF MOUNT OLYMPUS, I'M THE KINGPIN."
msgstr "올림포스 산 전체에서 내가 두목이다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "QUICKER WITH THE BOLTS THAN USAIN!"
msgstr "번개는 우사인보다 빠르다!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "A CURSE UPON...oh, wait, that's not my domain."
msgstr "저주를 내리노라... 아, 잠깐, 그건 내 소관이 아니군."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "A SCORE OF MORTAL PROGENY...no, wait, not my domain."
msgstr "수많은 인간 자손을... 아니, 잠깐, 내 소관이 아니군."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "ON THE FIRST DAY OF...nevermind, not my followship."
msgstr "성탄절 첫째 날에... 됐다, 내 교단이 아니군."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "THUNDERRRRRRRRRSTRUCK!"
msgstr "썬더어어어어스트럭!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "ATTACK!"
msgstr "공격!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "DO YOU KNOW MY SON, MARS? SORRY FOR YOUR LOSS IF SO"
msgstr "내 아들 마르스 알아? 안다면 유감이군"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "I CHISELLED THESE ABS MYSELF."
msgstr "이 복근은 내가 직접 깎았다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "PERFECTION IS WHATEVER I REST MY GAZE UPON."
msgstr "내 시선이 닿는 곳이 곧 완벽함이다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "WHEN YOU GET TO RIVER STYX...TELL MY DOG HE'S STINKY."
msgstr "스틱스 강에 가거든... 내 개한테 냄새난다고 전해라."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "WANT TO GET MARRIED? NO? OK."
msgstr "결혼할래? 싫어? 알았어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "WANT TO DATE? NO? OK."
msgstr "사귈래? 싫어? 알았어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "COME BACK TO MY PLACE WITH ME. IT'S LTIERALLY HEAVEN."
msgstr "우리 집에 가자. 말 그대로 천국이야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "THESE ZOMBIES WOULD SLAY THEIR OWN MAKER?"
msgstr "이 좀비들이 자기 창조주를 죽이겠다고?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "NOBODY WILL EVER BELIEVE YOU."
msgstr "아무도 네 말을 믿지 않을 거다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "I DON'T NEED FOOD...BUT I SURE DO WANT FOOD."
msgstr "난 음식이 필요 없어... 하지만 먹고 싶긴 하지."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "LESS ZOMBIES...MORE WOMEN!"
msgstr "좀비는 적게... 여자는 많이!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "IF YOU'RE EVER TEMPTED, DON'T GO TO VALHALLA. IT SUCKS."
msgstr "혹시 유혹이 들더라도 발할라엔 가지 마. 구려."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/zeus.df"
msgid "IF YOU THINK I'M HORRIBLE, YOU SHOULD MEET ODIN."
msgstr "내가 끔찍하다고 생각하면, 오딘을 만나 봐라."

#: deathforth/boot-end.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/boot-end.df"
msgid "Thanks for checking out Wayward Souls!"
msgstr "Wayward Souls를 확인해 주셔서 감사합니다!"

#: deathforth/boot-end.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/boot-end.df"
msgid "10 ZOMBO POINTS earned!"
msgstr "좀보 포인트 10점 획득!"

#: deathforth/boot-end.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/boot-end.df"
msgid ""
"You are over the maximum for Zombo Points!\r\n"
"\t\t\tSpend your excess ZP in the UNLOCKS section before starting a new game!"
msgstr ""
"좀보 포인트가 최대치를 넘었습니다!\r\n"
"\t\t\t새 게임을 시작하기 전에 해금 메뉴에서 초과한 ZP를 사용하세요!"

#: deathforth/boot-end.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/boot-end.df"
msgid "WAYWARD SOULS 1.0 LAUNCH!"
